{
  "id": "46",
  "title": "看命入式",
  "guide": "本篇讨论“看命入式”相关旧法。阅读时先提取月令、日主、透藏、制化与岁运等条件，再与其他章节交叉核对，不直接套用结果性断语。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "五行提纲，凡看命排下八字，以日干为主。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "46-064de34badb9269e27f9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "取年为根，为上祖财产，知世运之盛衰。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "46-529589b268a44a668fbe-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "取月为苗，为父母，则知亲荫之有无。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "46-2820f1753eeb900a563e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日干为己身，日支为妻妾，则知妻妾之贤淑。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "46-bc7c664533b37570f898-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "时为花实，为子息，方知嗣续之所归。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "46-04a263483185fd4aa9a5-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "法分月气深浅，得令不得令。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "46-4d555538d876864374b6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "年时露出财官，须要身旺；如身衰财旺，但多反破财伤妻。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "46-02e30266d12bd6c51457-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身旺财多财亦旺，财多称意。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "46-f45d88933e2024de8913-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "若无财官，次看印綬得何局式，吉凶断之。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "46-a5e7eb954c247438762b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "学者不可拘执，而不知通变也。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "46-0784ec6283bb72b9eb2d-0",
      "translation": null
    }
  ],
  "editionId": "yuanhai-6fbd3c1c68ee5326ccef",
  "version": "ca513874fd5e3ef7467b"
}
